334 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (To be a woman is to be a warrior A fighter for love, care, life, and rights. Facing many struggles in her life With every battle a hope is born. So being a woman isn't a easy task So let's make us shine bright, Let our voices be heard. We are women, we are proud, we are strong , We will rise, we will shine, we will be the backbone of the society We are woman, we are the Spark, Whatever the situations in our life We have to face it with a confidence ; Being a woman we will never ever give up.)
