<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (One random day, seeking solace in a book at the park, Zara encountered a stranger who would change her life's course. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
550 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A young man approached her with genuine curiosity and asked, "Is everything okay?". His words, so simple yet so profound, unlocked a floodgate of emotions in Zara. For the first time, someone noticed her pain. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
551 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Without a word, tears welled up in her eyes, speaking volumes of the anguish she carried silently for so long. The young man, sensing her distress, reached out and gently held her hand.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
