559 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Zara was taken aback by his kindness and sincerity. She saw in him a beacon of hope amidst her darkness. "Thank you," she managed to whisper, feeling a glimmer of trust she hadn't felt in years. )
/E (Zara was taken aback by his kindness and sincerity. She saw in him a beacon of hope amidst her darkness. "Thank you," she managed to whisper, feeling a glimmer of trust she hadn't felt in years. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
560 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (He continued, "When I first saw you, I noticed a beautiful aura of light around you. It's rare and signifies that you are not just a girl; you are an intellectual angel sent by the universe. I want to help you overcome your struggles and protect that igniting spark within you." )
/E (He continued, "When I first saw you, I noticed a beautiful aura of light around you. It's rare and signifies that you are not just a girl; you are an intellectual angel sent by the universe. I want to help you overcome your struggles and protect that igniting spark within you." )
