561 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Their connection deepened as they spent more time together. He became her confidant, unravelling the layers of pain she had buried within. With his support, Zara found the courage to confront her past and reclaim her sense of self worth. Months passed, and their bond blossomed into a love that neither had expected. Against all odds, an unexpected stranger had become the most important person in Zara's life. )
