/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Fact Box: Key Milestones  1936: Kabaddi introduced as a demonstration sport at the Berlin Olympics.  1950: All India Kabaddi Federation established; standardized rules created.  1990: Kabaddi becomes an official sport at the Asian Games.  2004: International Kabaddi Federation \(IKF\) established. 2014: Pro Kabaddi League \(PKL\) launched in India, popularizing the sport globally. )
/E (Fact Box: Key Milestones  1936: Kabaddi introduced as a demonstration sport at the Berlin Olympics.  1950: All India Kabaddi Federation established; standardized rules created.  1990: Kabaddi becomes an official sport at the Asian Games.  2004: International Kabaddi Federation \(IKF\) established. 2014: Pro Kabaddi League \(PKL\) launched in India, popularizing the sport globally. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
